There is an update to the case of Maksim Silnikau, who was extradited from Poland to the U.S. in August 2024 to stand trial here.  Ionut Arghire reports: The Belarusian creator and administrator of the Ransom Cartel ransomware was sentenced to 16 years in prison in the US. Maksim Silnikau, 40, built the ransomware operation...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/08/06/belarusian-ransom-cartel-mastermind-gets-16-years-in-prison/">Source</a></p>

